{"title": "Ability Drain", "pageid": 20547, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ability_Drain", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ability_Drain.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Ability_Drain.webp/300px-Ability_Drain.webp, /w/images/2/2a/Ability_Drain.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Ability_Drain.webp/300px-Ability_Drain.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Ability_Drain.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Ability Drain</b> is a passive feature and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. Once per turn while attacking, this ability reduces the target's relevant <a href=\"/wiki/Ability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability\">Ability</a> score by 1.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per turn, when you make an <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>, the attack reduces that target's corresponding Ability by 1. The reduced ability score cannot be decreased lower than 1. \n</p><p>The ability that is reduced is the same as the one used to make the Attack Roll.\n</p><p>For melee weapons, this is usually <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, for ranged weapons usually <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, and for spells usually your <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting Modifier\">Spellcasting Ability</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ability_Drain:_Strength\"> Condition: Ability Drain: Strength </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Strength_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Strength (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain: Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Ability_Drain_Strength_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain:_Strength_(Condition)\" title=\"Ability Drain: Strength (Condition)\">Ability Drain: Strength</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Strength reduced by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/38px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/50px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/25px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ability Drain</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ability_Drain:_Dexterity\"> Condition: Ability Drain: Dexterity </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-b